description:
This is a combined synopsis/solicitation for commercial items prepared in accordance with the format in FAR Part 12.&nbsp; This announcement constitutes the only solicitation.&nbsp; Quotations are being requested and a separate written solicitation will not be issued.&nbsp; 

Solicitation number 1240BE27Q0022 is issued as a Request for Quotation (RFQ) for snow and ice removal at the Northern Research Station Irvine Lab in Irvine, Pennsylvania. 

This acquisition&nbsp; is set-aside for small business concerns.&nbsp; The applicable North American Industry Classification Standard Code is 561730&nbsp; The small business size standard is $9.5 mil. &nbsp;This acquisition is a Total Small Business Set-Aside.&nbsp; All responsible sources may submit a quotation which will be considered by the agency.&nbsp; 

See Attachment 1 - Performance Work Statement for a complete list of requirements.&nbsp; 

There will be an informal site visit on December 2, 2026 at 10:00 AM ET.&nbsp; No RSVP is necessary. All questions shall be submitted to Andrea Pollock at &nbsp;andrea.pollock@usda.gov but December 4, 2026 at 12:00 PM ET. An amendment will be posted to provide all quoters the questions and answers.
